# Argo CD System Configuration

This directory contains the core manifests for Argo CD.

## Initial Bootstrap (Day 0)

Argo CD must be manually applied once to the cluster before GitOps auto-sync takes over:

```bash
# 1. Create namespace
kubectl create namespace argocd

# 2. Install Argo CD core engine
kubectl apply -n argocd --server-side -f system/install.yaml

# 3. Apply the root application (self-management)
kubectl apply -n argocd -f system/root-argocd-app.yaml